{"ID":"20240314092303-9qi29bu","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314092303-9qi29bu","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314092303-9qi29bu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422160146-eipluus\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422160146-5bw4pnr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422160146-5bw4pnr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:309,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:309\u0026#125;","title":"【矾石汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422160146"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422160146-eipluus","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422160146-eipluus","updated":"20240422160146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"矾石汤，治脚气冲心。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160146-5q0smnt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160146-5q0smnt","updated":"20240422160146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"矾石汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422160146-qr0bpxa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160146-qr0bpxa","updated":"20240422160146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"矾石二两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422160146-1xw50gt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160146-1xw50gt","updated":"20240422160146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右一味，以浆水一斗五升，煎三五沸，浸脚良"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422160146-5bw4pnr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160146-5bw4pnr","updated":"20240422160146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个“礬石湯”呢，礬石本身能够除湿，力量很强，所以用礬石呢，这个一味药，用水来滚它，滚个三五沸就好了，专门泡脚用的，外用的药是治疗脚气，脚气的时候可能有红肿，脚外面有红肿啊，那个肿一直往上升，从脚底板一直往上走，那原因呢，可能是破伤风或者什么的，你不用管它，或者是单纯的这个丹毒啊，脚气啊......反正一直往上走，任何的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"脚上的发的病一直往身上走"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就叫做“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"脚气冲心"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，所以说，千万不要说被......这个经方就是这样子啊，“脚气冲心”，他脚气有很多原因，你不要去看什么病名，只要看到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"脚红肿、发炎，红肿那个从脚一发起来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，肿起来，一直往身上走，就是冲心......往心脏走，这个你都可以用外面的外洗方来泡脚，都可以使用它。"}]}]}